# E-Commerce Orders Analysis

## Project Overview
This project focuses on analyzing e-commerce orders for August 2026 to understand sales performance and extract useful business insights.

## Dataset Information
- **Project:** E-Commerce Orders – August 2026
- **Number of Orders:** 40
- **Currency:** Egyptian Pound (EGP)

## Project Objectives
- Inspect and clean the dataset.
- Analyze sales performance.
- Calculate total revenue and average order value.
- Identify top-selling products.
- Create visualizations to present key findings.

## Tools & Technologies
- Python
- Pandas
- NumPy
- Matplotlib
- Jupyter Notebook

## Project Structure
The repository will contain the analysis notebook, dataset (if available for sharing), and visualizations as applicable.

## Results
Analysis findings and visualizations will be added after completing the analysis.

